      "path": "/books/al-kafi:6:9:2:7",
      "text": [
        " اضْرِبُوهَا عَلَى النِّفَارِ وَ لَا تَضْرِبُوهَا عَلَى الْعِثَارِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "And it is reported, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from the Prophet<sup>saww</sup> having said: ‘Strike it (animal) upon the fleeing, and do not strike it upon the stumbling’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "7. It is narrated from the Holy Prophet, O Allah, grant compensation to Muhammad and his family worthy of their services to Your cause, who has said:‘You may hit your stumpers for running away in fright but not because of their stumbling.’” "
        ]
      }
